<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Hi {{{Recipient.Name}}},<br />
As you may already know, starting January 2025, a new FCC rule will require internet lead providers like EverQuote to collect "1:1 consent" for internet leads. As a result of this new rule, we expect lead volume to experience some downward pressure in 2025, but importantly, we also expect conversion rates to <a href="http://increase.to/" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" target="_blank">increase.To</a> prepare for these changes, we’re proactively testing a model where our leads will be sold <i>exclusively</i> to a single agency. Our initial testing shows these exclusive leads have significantly higher conversion rates!<b><i>By opting to receive our 'exclusive leads,' you can access more high-performing leads while maintaining your lead volume.</i></b><br />
